# 23. Data Exfiltration and Wireshark

Wireshark can help analysts examine authorized packet captures.

Useful observations include:

- Source/destination IP
- Protocol
- DNS activity
- Connection frequency
- Packet sizes
- Traffic volume
- TLS metadata

### Important

Encrypted application content may not be directly visible.

