Remember:

> **C-P-T**

### C — Collect

Gather target data.

### P — Prepare

Stage/compress/encrypt.

### T — Transfer

Move data outside.

```text
COLLECT
   ↓
PREPARE
   ↓
TRANSFER
```

---

# 36. DEFENSIVE MEMORY TRICK

Remember:

> **D-L-C**

### D — Detect

Find unusual data movement.

### L — Limit

Control the transfer.

### C — Correlate

Combine endpoint, network, identity, and DLP evidence.

