# 38. DAY 55 FINAL TAKEAWAY

> **Data exfiltration is the unauthorized transfer of information from a protected environment. Defenders detect it by combining endpoint, network, DNS, identity, cloud, and DLP telemetry rather than relying on a single indicator.**

### Most important formula:

```text
COLLECT
   ↓
STAGE
   ↓
TRANSFER
   ↓
EXFILTRATION
```

### Defensive formula:

```text
MONITOR
   ↓
DETECT
   ↓
VALIDATE
   ↓
CONTAIN
   ↓
INVESTIGATE
   ↓
RECOVER
```

> **The goal of studying exfiltration techniques is not to steal data; it is to understand how unauthorized data movement occurs so that organizations can detect, prevent, and respond to it.**